<title>USA: WCI Steel to raise prices 2 or 3 pct.</title>
<headline>WCI Steel to raise prices 2 or 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, Ohio 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>WCI Steel Inc said on Friday that it will increase prices by two or three percent on hot-rolled, cold-rolled and coated products, effective with shipments May 4, 1997.</p>
<p>The price increases will follow the pattern set recently by other integrated steel producers, WCI said.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
